And can answer:

> Was Cₙ₊₁ actually authorized to become active?



> What happened to each delegation?



> Which ELIXERS were compatible?



> Which actions occurred before and after the boundary?




---

XIX. 🌸 HARUM — HUMAN MIGRATION VIEW

HARUM translates the transition into:

> PALACO is updating its constitutional rules.

From: Constitution Cₙ
To: Constitution Cₙ₊₁

Effective: 12:00

Affected: Delegation rules, selected ELIXERS

Your active permissions: 2 preserved, 1 narrowed

External actions: temporarily restricted during transition

Status: Verified transition



This is the human-readable face of constitutional evolution.


