UNDER WHICH AGREEMENT
WITH WHICH SCOPE
AT WHAT TIME


---

XI. ⏳ CROSS-VERSION TIME

Suppose:

A:
C₇ active at 10:00

B:
C₈ active at 10:00

Federation contract:
F₃ active at 10:00

Then the federated action is evaluated against:

STATE_A(10:00)
+
STATE_B(10:00)
+
STATE_F(10:00)

Not today's state.

Therefore:

FEDERATED_STATE(t)

becomes a first-class replay concept.


