WATERMARK...

Instead:

> Shared action requires cooperation between two Citadels.

Your Citadel permits: analysis
Partner Citadel permits: analysis
Federation permits: analysis only
External actions: prohibited
Evidence: required
Status: verified



HARUM converts constitutional complexity into human comprehension.

Without turning comprehension into authority.


---

XV. 🔄 FEDERATED REVOCATION

Suppose:

A delegates X
B accepts X
Federation permits X

Then:

A REVOKES X

The shared authority must be reevaluated.

LOCAL REVOCATION
      ↓
FEDERATED AUTHORITY
      ↓
RE-EVALUATION

The system must never continue using the old state merely because the federative contract has not yet been updated.

The revocation remains part of the causal chain.


---

