REPLAY CONFLICT AT T

including:

FEDERATION_STATE(t)
MEMBERSHIP_STATE(t)
CONSTITUTION_A(t)
CONSTITUTION_B(t)
FEDERATION_RULES(t)
AUTHORITIES(t)
EVIDENCE(t)
CHALLENGES(t)
JURISDICTION(t)
CONFLICT_STATE(t)
DETERMINATION(t)
REMEDY_STATE(t)

The verifier can then determine:

VALID
INVALID
CONFLICTED
DEADLOCKED
UNPROVEN


