FEDERATION DISPUTE PANEL

Its mandate must specify:

jurisdiction
composition
term
scope
recusal rules
evidence rules
appeal rules
remedy authority

A panel outside its mandate produces:

OUT_OF_SCOPE DETERMINATION

not valid authority.


