FINALITY CONDITION

A final determination means:

NO FURTHER VALID FEDERATIVE REVIEW

It does not mean:

THE DETERMINATION IS PHILOSOPHICALLY INFALLIBLE

Again:

procedural finality ≠ metaphysical truth.


