ARE HISTORICAL STATES PRESERVED?

ARE OLD CONTRACTS STILL VALID?

WERE TRANSITION RULES EXPLICIT?

CAN THE MIGRATION BE REPLAYED?

FOOL therefore protects constitutional continuity against evolutionary shortcuts.


