XX. 🚫 NO HISTORICAL ERASURE

This invariant becomes fundamental:

> No constitutional migration SHALL erase the historical existence of the state from which it migrated.



Therefore:

QUAY
=
IMMUTABLE CONSTITUTIONAL MEMORY

The current federation state can change.

The historical chain cannot be rewritten.


