XXVI. 🛡️ EVOLUTION SAFETY PRINCIPLE

R7.04 establishes:

> A federation SHALL NOT evolve faster than its ability to prove continuity.



Operationally:

CHANGE
 ↓
PROOF
 ↓
MIGRATION
 ↓
ACTIVATION

not:

