BRAINPOWER receives:

SERVICE
+
PARTICIPANTS
+
CONSTITUTIONS
+
TRUST ANCHORS
+
DEPENDENCIES
+
CONTRACT
+
FAILURE MODES

and determines candidate models such as:

COMPATIBLE
