Suppose:

A
B
C

all depend upon:

ONE TRUST ANCHOR

If that anchor fails:

ANCHOR
  ↓
FEDERATION
  ↓
EVERYTHING FAILS

This creates:

FEDERATED_SINGLE_POINT_OF_CONSTITUTIONAL_FAILURE

R7.07 therefore requires explicit dependency analysis.


