> Shared roots do not require a shared trunk.



Citadels may depend upon:

common evidence
common time
common infrastructure
common verification
common interoperability

while remaining constitutionally distinct.

Therefore:

DEPENDENCY
≠
SOVEREIGNTY

and:

COMMON SERVICE
≠
COMMON CONSTITUTION


