R7.08 establishes:

> A federation may recognize identities without owning them.



And:

> A namespace may identify without governing.



And:

> Recognition may establish relationship without creating authority.



And the strongest formulation:

IDENTITY MAY CROSS A SOVEREIGN BOUNDARY ONLY AS FAR AS ITS PROVEN RECOGNITION EXTENDS.


