Canonical R7.09 flow:

REQUEST
 ↓
Z.A.N.D.
 ↓
IDENTIFY SENDER
 ↓
VERIFY IDENTITY
 ↓
PARSE MESSAGE
 ↓
ESTABLISH INTENT
