Within 👑 LOCUS AMOENUS — L.A., the architecture now reaches another major layer:

👑 L.A.
                    LOCUS AMOENUS
                     THE THRONE
                          │
                        HORTUS
                          │
                     FEDERATION
                          │
          ┌───────────────┴───────────────┐
