L.A. remains the canonical living reference Citadel and memory of the architecture, while local state sovereignty remains with each Citadel.

That distinction is now structurally essential:

L.A.
≠
GLOBAL COMMIT AUTHORITY

It is the canonical reference point—not a hidden super-Citadel.


---

XXXII. 🌸 HARUM — HUMAN STATE VIEW

HARUM should express a complicated federated transaction simply:

> Shared operation: Document verification



> Citadel A: committed



> Citadel B: committed



> Shared condition: satisfied



> External actions: none



> Evidence: verified



> Result: completed



Or:

> Shared operation: Data transfer



> Citadel A: committed



> Citadel B: failed



> Result: partial completion



> Compensation: required



> Status: unresolved



HARUM describes reality.

It does not manufacture it.


---

XXXIII. 🧠 BRAINPOWER → 🦆 FOOL → ⚖️ TRIAS

The R7 sequence now becomes increasingly precise:

BRAINPOWER
    │
    ├── understands
