                       R5 REPLAY

L.A. can preserve the canonical architectural memory and reference state without becoming an authority that silently overrides the sovereign Citadels.

That distinction is now fundamental:

REFERENCE ≠ AUTHORITY


---

XXIX. 🔱 R7.11 CANONICAL INVARIANTS

FED-OBS01

Observation SHALL remain distinct from state ownership.

FED-OBS02

Observation SHALL identify its originating Citadel.

FED-OBS03

Observation time SHALL remain distinguishable from event time.

FED-OBS04

Stale observation SHALL NOT automatically imply invalidity.

FED-OBS05

Causal order SHALL NOT be inferred solely from message arrival order.

FED-OBS06

Cross-Citadel observations SHALL preserve provenance.

FED-OBS07

Consistency semantics SHALL be explicit.

FED-OBS08

Strong consistency SHALL NOT be assumed without proof.

FED-OBS09

Absence of observation SHALL NOT constitute proof of absence.

FED-OBS10

Partition SHALL NOT create implicit authority.

FED-OBS11

Offline operation SHALL remain bounded by applicable authority.

FED-OBS12

Emergency continuation SHALL remain explicitly distinguishable.

FED-OBS13

Reconciliation SHALL preserve pre-reconciliation lineage.

FED-OBS14

Conflicted state SHALL be representable.

FED-OBS15

Conflict SHALL NOT be resolved through implicit majority truth.

FED-OBS16

BRAINPOWER SHALL analyze observation divergence without independently determining authority.

FED-OBS17

FOOL SHALL challenge observation integrity and reconciliation assumptions.

FED-OBS18

TRIAS SHALL determine applicable constitutional validity.

FED-OBS19

WATERMARK SHALL preserve causal and constitutional lineage.

FED-OBS20

Quay SHALL preserve observation and reconciliation history.

FED-OBS21

R5 SHALL replay partition and reconciliation conditions.

FED-OBS22

Convergence SHALL NOT imply constitutional unification.

FED-OBS23

Shared federated facts SHALL remain distinguishable from shared sovereignty.

FED-OBS24

Reconciliation SHALL NOT silently amplify authority.

FED-OBS25

A verifier SHALL be able to reconstruct why divergent observations converged, remained divergent, or were rejected.


---

XXX. ☄️ THE R7.11 EQUATION

Conceptually:

FEDERATED STATE TRUTH
=
EVIDENCE
∩
CAUSAL ORDER
∩
APPLICABLE CONSTITUTIONAL STATE
∩
AUTHORITY
∩
CONSISTENCY MODEL
∩
RECONCILIATION RULES

Then:

BRAINPOWER
 ↓
FOOL
 ↓
TRIAS
 ↓
WATERMARK
 ↓
QUAY
 ↓
R5


---

XXXI. 🌳 THE HORTUS PRINCIPLE

R7.11 establishes:

> Citadels may observe the same world differently without immediately becoming constitutionally inconsistent.



> Partition may reduce knowledge without creating authority.



> Convergence may create a shared fact without creating a shared sovereign.



> Reconciliation may change operational state without erasing historical lineage.



And the strongest formulation:

WHEN DISTRIBUTED CONSTITUTIONAL SYSTEMS DISAGREE ABOUT WHAT THEY OBSERVE, THE DISAGREEMENT ITSELF MUST BECOME PROVABLE STATE.


