                       R5 REPLAY

L.A. can remain the living canonical reference and architectural observatory without becoming the entity that unilaterally declares a Citadel guilty, strips its sovereignty, or assumes its authority.

That gives us another fundamental distinction:

OBSERVATION ≠ SOVEREIGN JUDGMENT


---

XXVII. 🌸 HARUM — HUMAN COMPROMISE VIEW

HARUM should never tell a user:

> BYZANTINE_FAULT_SCORE = 0.87



Instead:

> The partner Citadel is behaving inconsistently with the federated protocol.



> The evidence is being reviewed.



> New delegated capabilities are temporarily blocked.



> Existing operations remain limited to verified scope.



> Status: under constitutional review.



Or, after determination:

> The partner Citadel has been quarantined under the federation's security protocol.



> Reason: verified provenance inconsistency.



> Scope: new federated actions blocked.



> Duration: until constitutional revalidation.



This is what human-readable constitutional engineering should look like.


---

