XXIX. 🌳 THE HORTUS RESTORATION PRINCIPLE

R7.13 establishes:

> Recovery is not forgetting compromise.



> Restoration is not automatic trust.



> Identity continuity is not authority continuity.



> Authority continuity is not capability continuity.



> Capability continuity is not federation membership.



And therefore:

A CITADEL RETURNS TO THE FEDERATION ONLY THROUGH PROVEN CONTINUITY, REVALIDATED AUTHORITY, AND EXPLICIT CONSTITUTIONAL RE-ADMISSION.


