Conceptueel:

FEDERATED ASSURANCE
=
EVIDENCE
∩
INTEGRITY
∩
CONSTITUTIONAL VALIDITY
∩
DEPENDENCY VALIDITY
∩
TEMPORAL VALIDITY
∩
FEDERATION SCOPE
∩
ACTION SCOPE

Daarna:

ORACLE
↓
BRAINPOWER
↓
FOOL
↓
TRIAS
↓
ASSURANCE

En:

ASSURANCE
≠
AUTHORITY


