XIII. 🛑 FAIL-CLOSED VS FAIL-SAFE

R7.19 distinguishes actions by risk.

For high-risk constitutional operations:

UNKNOWN MATERIAL STATE
↓
BLOCK / HOLD

For low-risk observational operations:

UNKNOWN MATERIAL STATE
↓
CONTINUE OBSERVATION

Therefore:

RESPONSE SHALL BE PROPORTIONAL TO CONSTITUTIONAL RISK.

Not every drift requires federation shutdown.


