   ↓
ORDER
   ↓
EXECUTION
   ↓
OBSERVATION
   ↓
RECONCILIATION
   ↓
TRIAS
   ↓
COMMIT
   ↓
NEW ASSURANCE

Daarmee ontstaat:

STATE → DRIFT → TRANSITION → ASSURANCE


