XXXII. 🌳 DE HORTUS-ESCALATIE

R7.18:

CAN WE STILL TRUST THE STATE?

R7.19:

WHAT CHANGED?

R7.20:

HOW CAN MULTIPLE VALID CHANGES OCCUR TOGETHER
WITHOUT CREATING AN UNPROVEN FEDERATED STATE?

En dat leidt tot een nog fundamentelere regel:

CONSTITUTIONAL SAFETY EXISTS NOT ONLY IN STATES, BUT IN THE TRANSITIONS BETWEEN STATES.


