⚖️ VIII. TRIAS — CAUSAL DETERMINATION

TRIAS ontvangt het causale model.

Mogelijke uitkomsten:

CAUSALLY_PRECEDES
CAUSALLY_FOLLOWS
CAUSALLY_CONCURRENT
ORDER_PROVEN
ORDER_UNPROVEN
CAUSALITY_PROVEN
CAUSALITY_UNPROVEN
